{"id":"model-de-caixa","title":"Model de caixa","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":69,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-07-18-05-26","title":"Sesion_07_18.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":7}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>En web, tot es considera una caixa rectangular amb quatre capes: el <strong>contingut</strong> (text/imatge), el <strong>padding</strong>, la <strong>vora</strong> (border) i el <strong>marge</strong> (margin). Entendre com se sumen aquestes mides és vital per quadrar el disseny .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.bloque</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">300px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2px</span> solid black;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">30px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">box-sizing</span>: border-box; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Fa que l&#x27;amplada inclogui el padding i el border */</span>\n}</code></pre></div>"}